{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Algorithmic Due Process.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Algorithmic Due Process.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"algorithmic due process algorithmic due process","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Algorithmic Due Process.md","fileName":"Algorithmic Due Process.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Algorithmic Due Process","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 23:09\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[AI Governance and Responsible Innovation]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Governance and Responsible Innovation","Right to Explanation","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Algorithmic Due Process.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Algorithmic Due Process.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"algorithmic due process algorithmic due process","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Algorithmic Due Process.md","fileName":"Algorithmic Due Process.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Algorithmic Due Process","heading":"Algorithmic Due Process","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Algorithmic due process applies procedural fairness to decisions made or supported by automated systems. A person affected by a consequential decision should know that automation was used, understand the relevant basis, receive a comprehensible reason, and have a real opportunity to challenge errors.\n\nThe requirement connects [[Right to Explanation]] with institutional remedy. Disclosure without appeal leaves the person's position unchanged, while an appeal without adequate information cannot test the system's reasoning. Due process also requires a responsible human or organization with authority to review and correct the outcome rather than treating the model as final.","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Governance and Responsible Innovation","Right to Explanation","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Algorithmic Due Process.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Algorithmic Due Process.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"algorithmic due process algorithmic due process","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Algorithmic Due Process.md","fileName":"Algorithmic Due Process.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Algorithmic Due Process","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[aiethics.epub]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Governance and Responsible Innovation","Right to Explanation","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}